msgctxt "64"
msgid "Thank you for taking the time to do this, Master Utabori."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "I appreciate it, old man! Sorry for blowin' my lid at you earlier."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"I suggest you learn some manners, boy. In the meantime, feel free to come "
"back to me if the color ever begins to fade. I'll maintain all my work for "
"as long as I live."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "I'll be back for sure. Gotta keep that Utabori touch intact!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Come on, Rikiya. We should get going. Thank you again, Master."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Take care of yourselves."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "You got 10,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

